{
    "title": "Vrbo Vacation Rentals",
    "description": "When other vacation rentals feel like a lot of work, try one that feels like a vacation. Whether you\u2019re looking for a beach bungalow, an A-frame in the mountains, or a place in town, Vrbo is a more relaxing vacation home option, from booking to checkout. \r\n\r\nWhy get shortchanged when you can get rewarded? One Key is a rewards program you won't find on any other vacation rentals platform. Earn and use rewards on eligible vacation homes, flights, hotels, car rentals, and more across our family of brands.\r\n\r\n- <b>EARN OneKeyCash\u2122\r\n- <b>SEARCH</b> for private places to stay in 190+ countries \r\n\r\n- <b>PLAN</b> and collaborate with your people using Trip Planner and group chat \r\n\r\n- <b>USE FLEXIBLE DATE SEARCH</b> to help you compare booking options & prices across multiple dates \r\n\r\n- <b>GET LONG STAY DISCOUNTS</b> on select vacation rentals \r\n\r\n- <b>BOOK</b> securely from your phone or tablet \r\n\r\n- <b>GET 24/7 SUPPORT</b> from a real person for any issues that come up \r\n\r\n- <b>TRAVEL</b> anywhere and share trip details with your group \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>REWARDS\r\n \r\n\u2022 One Key is the first loyalty program from a major vacation rentals platform.  \r\n \r\n\u2022 Book and earn rewards on eligible vacation rentals.  \r\n \r\n\u2022 Use OneKeyCash across Expedia, Vrbo, and Hotels.com.  \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>SEARCH</b> \r\n\r\n\u2022 Browse private vacation rentals complete with pools, backyards, and more. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Find unique homes not listed on other platforms. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Filter by preference: price, location, amenities, and more. \r\n\r\n\u2022 See rental photos and reviews at a glance. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Have questions about a property? Get quick answers from our virtual assistant. \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>PLAN</b> \r\n\r\n\u2022 Tap the heart icon to save and compare your favorite rentals easily. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Invite friends and family to join your Trip Planner. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Leave comments and vote for your favorite places. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Keep your trip conversations in one place and chat with your group in real time from anywhere. \r\n\r\n \r\n<b>FLEXIBLE DATE SEARCH </b> \r\n\r\n\u2022 Easily compare prices & booking options across multiple dates. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Search for properties within days, weeks, or a range of months. \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>LONG STAY DISCOUNTS</b> \r\n\r\n\u2022 earn discounts on longer stays at participating properties. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Choose from a wide range of vacation rentals & save 10% on select properties with extended bookings. \r\n\r\n \r\n<b>BOOK</b> \r\n\r\n\u2022 Have questions about your booking? Message the host to ask about the property. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Book and pay securely in the Vrbo app with your credit card. \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>24/7 SUPPORT</b> \r\n\r\n\u2022Any issues? Contact our 24/7 customer service team.  \r\n\r\n\u2022 Connect with a live person any time before, during, and after your trip. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Reach a real person in about a minute, by phone or chat (US only). \r\n\r\n\r\n<b>TRAVEL</b> \r\n\r\n\u2022 Quickly access important booking details like check-in instructions, WiFi passwords, and arrival information, even when offline. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Share important trip details with your people by inviting them to your trip. \r\n\r\n\u2022 Access your conversations and message homeowners from your device anytime. \r\n\r\nThis app uses tracking technology. As disclosed in our Privacy Statement, we and our partners may collect personal information and other data. By using our app, you accept our Privacy Statement and Terms of Service.\r\n\r\nNote: Unless otherwise noted, currency is displayed as USD in the property listings. Please visit www.vrbo.com/mobile for more information about the Vrbo app.</b></b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "When other vacation rentals feel like a lot of work, try one that feels like a vacation. Whether you\u2019re looking for a beach bungalow, an A-frame in the mountains, or a place in town, Vrbo is a more relaxing vacation home option, from booking to checkout. <br><br>Why get shortchanged when you can get rewarded? One Key is a rewards program you won&#39;t find on any other vacation rentals platform. Earn and use rewards on eligible vacation homes, flights, hotels, car rentals, and more across our family of brands.<br><br>- <b>EARN OneKeyCash\u2122<br>- <b>SEARCH</b> for private places to stay in 190+ countries <br><br>- <b>PLAN</b> and collaborate with your people using Trip Planner and group chat <br><br>- <b>USE FLEXIBLE DATE SEARCH</b> to help you compare booking options &amp; prices across multiple dates <br><br>- <b>GET LONG STAY DISCOUNTS</b> on select vacation rentals <br><br>- <b>BOOK</b> securely from your phone or tablet <br><br>- <b>GET 24/7 SUPPORT</b> from a real person for any issues that come up <br><br>- <b>TRAVEL</b> anywhere and share trip details with your group <br><br><br><b>REWARDS<br> <br>\u2022 One Key is the first loyalty program from a major vacation rentals platform.  <br> <br>\u2022 Book and earn rewards on eligible vacation rentals.  <br> <br>\u2022 Use OneKeyCash across Expedia, Vrbo, and Hotels.com.  <br><br><br><b>SEARCH</b> <br><br>\u2022 Browse private vacation rentals complete with pools, backyards, and more. <br><br>\u2022 Find unique homes not listed on other platforms. <br><br>\u2022 Filter by preference: price, location, amenities, and more. <br><br>\u2022 See rental photos and reviews at a glance. <br><br>\u2022 Have questions about a property? Get quick answers from our virtual assistant. <br><br><br><b>PLAN</b> <br><br>\u2022 Tap the heart icon to save and compare your favorite rentals easily. <br><br>\u2022 Invite friends and family to join your Trip Planner. <br><br>\u2022 Leave comments and vote for your favorite places. <br><br>\u2022 Keep your trip conversations in one place and chat with your group in real time from anywhere. <br><br> <br><b>FLEXIBLE DATE SEARCH </b> <br><br>\u2022 Easily compare prices &amp; booking options across multiple dates. <br><br>\u2022 Search for properties within days, weeks, or a range of months. <br><br><br><b>LONG STAY DISCOUNTS</b> <br><br>\u2022 earn discounts on longer stays at participating properties. <br><br>\u2022 Choose from a wide range of vacation rentals &amp; save 10% on select properties with extended bookings. <br><br> <br><b>BOOK</b> <br><br>\u2022 Have questions about your booking? Message the host to ask about the property. <br><br>\u2022 Book and pay securely in the Vrbo app with your credit card. <br><br><br><b>24/7 SUPPORT</b> <br><br>\u2022Any issues? Contact our 24/7 customer service team.  <br><br>\u2022 Connect with a live person any time before, during, and after your trip. <br><br>\u2022 Reach a real person in about a minute, by phone or chat (US only). <br><br><br><b>TRAVEL</b> <br><br>\u2022 Quickly access important booking details like check-in instructions, WiFi passwords, and arrival information, even when offline. <br><br>\u2022 Share important trip details with your people by inviting them to your trip. <br><br>\u2022 Access your conversations and message homeowners from your device anytime. <br><br>This app uses tracking technology. As disclosed in our Privacy Statement, we and our partners may collect personal information and other data. By using our app, you accept our Privacy Statement and Terms of Service.<br><br>Note: Unless otherwise noted, currency is displayed as USD in the property listings. Please visit www.vrbo.com/mobile for more information about the Vrbo app.</b></b>",
